  "title": "Onboarding a Developer with AI: A Better First-Day Experience",
  "description": "Onboarding is one of the most underestimated areas of Developer Experience. This session demonstrates how AI can help a new developer become productive faster by explaining a codebase, surfacing useful context, identifying key components, and supporting a first contribution. The demo shows how AI can reduce frustration and shorten the time to meaningful impact.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
